Diberi ξ = {x : x ialah integer, 30 ≤ x ≤ 40}, set A = {x : x ialah gandaan 3}, set B = {x : x ialah hasil tambah dua digit adalah nombor ganjil}, dan C = {30, 32, 35, 39, 40}. 
(a) Senaraikan semua unsur:
(i) (A ∪ B)' ∩ C = {31, 35, 37, 40} ∩ C = {35, 40}
(ii) A' ∩ (B ∪ C) = {31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38, 40} ∩ {30, 32, 34, 35, 36, 38, 39, 40} = {32, 34, 35, 38, 40}
(iii) (A ∩ C)' ∪ (B ∩ C) = {31, 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 38, 40} ∪ {30, 32} = {30, 31, 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 38, 40}
(b) Lukis gambar rajah Venn dan lorekkan kawasan yang mewakili setiap set.
